<title>USA: IPO HIGHLIGHTS--RWD, Aurora rise.</title>
<headline>IPO HIGHLIGHTS--RWD, Aurora rise.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Two more initial public offerings, Aurora Biosciences Corp and RWD Technologies Inc, made strong debuts on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Both posted sharp gains of over a point on the heels of two earlier IPO debuts by StarTek Inc and ARM Financial Group Inc.</p>
<p>Shares of RWD were up 34 percent, adding 4-1/2 to 17-1/2 after its market debut from its IPO price of $13 a share. The stock was the highest percentage gainer on the Nasdaq.</p>
</text>
